<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities have arrested an alleged Jalisco New Generation Cartel leader in Zapopan and seized a cartel cell with DEA assistance, while a police helicopter opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7-year-old American girl. In Mazatlán, García Harfuch announced a US $48 million security package for Sinaloa. A major leader of the Jalisco cartel was also taken into custody. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOQkZDWkU2MFBSQ09IcWp0bmY3akRNSzROVEREQnVRTmdBblV5alFxZEVfZ0dXSkNnNmtCWXJTS1ZDVzlPSlRyRzJZTWgyX0tYaFAzblpUcUdDM3dSQjdNdkxGRGhrekc3bEtXQjJTTWpndFpJaXlZNUhlUzE3VU5GSnFHQjUwT215ei12Z1prd3UwTVItdzhaNTkyS0hpRVRzWGxmYWRGTkhFTFo4NmU2bG5UVmx5NldSeV9QUXlRVWxlQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOYXhEUmc1OTQzZmZqSU1adTk3UzFDSXBwLXQ0LVJTUkthMlpBQi0yNE40V1hLR0JuNG4wanpOZlIzTlBPMjZlN3lYTkVBbzRyQmVEOVJkcWtvWElJRHJfNE1vanRDcVFnUFlZcjJha0huX2J5clZmZU9HNTdvT2k3VmdWcmZyNHF2MUpSNloyeF9tdUxoOTlqb1pjbW1TSmdVRk1Kbnk5dlBpak96dF9WUGdtcHUtNlpTUnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNNFROWVBRZ2N1YVA5STl3Xy1pcUJsOHZKYjV4YXNNLXVobWVvWm5ZRHVWNjM4dFkwMFA3S0hVa3RlV1Z0VTJRRUljQTh5YlVQVE84ci1EcXVNN3hRRnA0Rk9pMEhYT28wZnk0c1pXdlFnUEtVb0NVZnNRRTc0UFhDWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo News Canada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQZFRVeUI3NmdBRlJvcmpyUGg1bmw4NVBPdEFleVZSMGhxaVdJWkNRTmJSc2l2TVl1c1pMRnJyY3EtbzBDaWM5aHc5ZzFxZ0J3QlFlcXR4N1c2UDJwV09TUlhLRzJnTkdGZ2x4TGtkTGttZnVDaFVhVFgwMzNPQ0JTVHNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mexico News Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://